+question = g.render(inst)
+answer = g.parse_answer(f"<answer>{g._format_answer(inst['answer'])}</answer>")
+assert g.verify(inst, answer) == (True, "ok")
+```
+
+Emit dataset records with:
+
+```bash
+bash scripts/emit.sh 2206.06261 20 easy
+```
