Completed a verified `TRACK = "A"` generator based on the factor-trapdoor construction licensed by Theorem 4.1 of the [paper](https://arxiv.org/abs/2206.06261).

Deliverables:

- [Generator module](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2206.06261/gen_2206_06261.py)
- [Self-test report](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2206.06261/selftest_report.json)
